# EdgeOne / Cloudflare Pages 长缓存策略（GitHub Pages 不读取此文件，静态资源文件名已带内容哈希）
/assets/app.*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/app.*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/photos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/assets/og-cover.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
